- FinScope 2024 indicators: Access to Finance Rwanda (AFR).
- District boundaries: geoBoundaries / NISR Open Data, CC BY 4.0.
- Manrope (SIL Open Font License 1.1) and Comfortaa (SIL Open Font License 1.1)
  are served by Google Fonts and are not redistributed here.
- JavaScript and Python dependencies keep the licences recorded in
  `web/package-lock.json` and `api/requirements.txt`.

Household-level rows in `data/processed/households.csv` are synthetic, produced
by `scripts/build_data.py`. They are not NISR microdata and must not be
presented as survey records.

